WEBVTT

00:01:46.050 --> 00:01:47.410
A fashion show?

00:01:47.950 --> 00:01:51.430
Yes, Mister Jinguji Ren.

00:01:51.430 --> 00:01:56.430
An offer has come for you to participate.

00:01:56.880 --> 00:01:59.550
It's a good opportunity for you to broaden your work.

00:01:59.550 --> 00:02:01.090
Proceed carefully.

00:02:13.010 --> 00:02:14.900
Have you heard the rumors?

00:02:15.850 --> 00:02:21.720
Some amateurs have already been nominated for the Uta Pri Award.

00:02:24.260 --> 00:02:28.450
I couldn't ask for anything better than a rival.

00:02:33.330 --> 00:02:39.760
It will be interesting to see if ST☆RISH can become real idols.

00:02:43.140 --> 00:02:46.560
What?! The Japan Boys Collection?

00:02:47.240 --> 00:02:49.510
You're going to be in that, Ren? You get to be in it?!

00:02:49.860 --> 00:02:50.990
Yeah.

00:02:50.990 --> 00:02:53.810
That's amazing, Ren!

00:02:54.290 --> 00:02:57.590
Hey, Tokiya. What's the Japan Boys?

00:02:57.590 --> 00:03:01.820
How do you not know about that, working in this industry?

00:03:03.860 --> 00:03:08.750
It's a fashion show featuring real clothes for young men.

00:03:08.750 --> 00:03:10.460
Real clothes?

00:03:10.460 --> 00:03:13.290
They're practical clothes that aren't too cutting-edge to wear.

00:03:13.680 --> 00:03:15.340
I see.

00:03:15.340 --> 00:03:20.330
It's a really popular fashion show with actors, singers,

00:03:20.330 --> 00:03:23.210
and magazine models in addition to professional models.

00:03:23.710 --> 00:03:25.740
You're so fashionable, Shou.

00:03:25.740 --> 00:03:27.490
I'm not surprised you're so familiar with it.

00:03:27.490 --> 00:03:28.840
Good for you.

00:03:28.840 --> 00:03:30.430
Cut it out, Natsuki!

00:03:31.750 --> 00:03:34.690
We've been doing pretty well lately.

00:03:34.690 --> 00:03:39.230
At this rate, we might actually be able to win the Uta Pri Award!

00:03:39.230 --> 00:03:40.250
You're right.

00:03:40.250 --> 00:03:41.360
We can do it!

00:03:46.500 --> 00:03:49.010
So, what happened?

00:03:50.020 --> 00:03:51.270
What do you mean?

00:03:51.910 --> 00:03:55.860
I've known you well since we were children.

00:03:55.860 --> 00:03:57.240
You cannot hide anything from me.

00:04:01.570 --> 00:04:04.980
Do you know the main sponsor of the Japan Boys Collection?

00:04:07.400 --> 00:04:08.220
Could it be...

00:04:08.220 --> 00:04:11.260
That's right. You know, don't you?

00:04:11.260 --> 00:04:15.160
My older brother ordered me to enter Saotome Academy.

00:04:15.820 --> 00:04:20.730
<i>As the eldest son, I must succeed our late father.</i>

00:04:21.080 --> 00:04:24.490
<i>Ren, go to Saotome Academy.</i>

00:04:25.210 --> 00:04:27.070
<i>Make a name for yourself in show business,</i>

00:04:27.070 --> 00:04:29.760
<i>and become a poster boy for the Jinguji family.</i>

00:04:30.660 --> 00:04:34.540
In other words, now that I've debuted as a member of ST☆RISH,

00:04:34.540 --> 00:04:38.040
he plans to start using me immediately.

00:04:40.900 --> 00:04:45.990
Jinguji, surely you understand the importance of this job.

00:04:46.830 --> 00:04:48.560
No matter who the sponsors are,

00:04:48.560 --> 00:04:51.260
you won't be allowed to do something so selfish.

00:04:51.700 --> 00:04:56.500
In any case, I'm nothing more than a management tool to my brother.

00:04:57.770 --> 00:05:00.880
A conglomerate only needs up to a second son.

00:05:00.880 --> 00:05:04.490
A third son is just a bonus.

00:05:05.570 --> 00:05:09.440
My brother and I have completely different lifestyles and values.

00:05:10.740 --> 00:05:13.430
We'll never understand each other.

00:05:13.900 --> 00:05:16.410
You should have refused, then.

00:05:17.580 --> 00:05:20.920
I don't care about that anymore.

00:05:22.300 --> 00:05:26.030
I've already found a goal.

00:05:38.550 --> 00:05:41.390
<i>What is it? I've got a meeting now.</i>

00:05:41.390 --> 00:05:42.760
<i>Go away.</i>

00:05:43.400 --> 00:05:46.310
<i>Mister Seiichiro, please hurry.</i>

00:05:46.310 --> 00:05:47.060
<i>Got it.</i>

00:06:08.810 --> 00:06:10.970
Hello, Little Lamb.

00:06:14.360 --> 00:06:15.570
Jinguji.

00:06:17.930 --> 00:06:19.560
You took my breath away.

00:06:21.220 --> 00:06:24.310
Seeing you shining in the sunlight...

00:06:25.010 --> 00:06:29.520
I thought you were a princess from a magical world.

00:06:29.520 --> 00:06:30.600
What?

00:06:31.400 --> 00:06:32.990
Are you working on ST☆RISH's new song?

00:06:34.230 --> 00:06:38.160
Yes, but it's not done yet...

00:06:39.180 --> 00:06:40.210
I see.

00:06:42.500 --> 00:06:46.910
You're always so positive, Little Lamb. I respect that.

00:06:46.910 --> 00:06:49.300
There's no need...

00:06:49.300 --> 00:06:52.210
Oh, I heard you're going to be in a show.

00:06:53.250 --> 00:06:54.020
Yeah.

00:06:55.440 --> 00:06:56.920
What's wrong?

00:06:58.360 --> 00:07:00.150
It's nothing.

00:07:01.410 --> 00:07:03.080
I've changed.

00:07:04.030 --> 00:07:06.100
You changed me.

00:07:06.100 --> 00:07:06.890
What?

00:07:07.890 --> 00:07:14.310
You found my passion for music that I had lost.

00:07:16.690 --> 00:07:17.830
Thank you.

00:07:18.720 --> 00:07:22.390
If I hadn't met you, I wouldn't be the person I am today.

00:07:22.390 --> 00:07:23.830
That's not true...

00:07:25.300 --> 00:07:28.330
But... I'm glad.

00:07:30.810 --> 00:07:35.350
I like your songs, Jinguji.

00:07:36.420 --> 00:07:40.540
When I listen to your music, my heart heats up.

00:07:41.140 --> 00:07:43.090
My heart lights up.

00:07:43.090 --> 00:07:44.410
My lady...

00:07:47.310 --> 00:07:48.440
I'm pleased to hear that.

00:07:49.010 --> 00:07:51.030
I couldn't ask for higher praise.

00:07:52.860 --> 00:07:57.990
I had no idea my songs were making you so hot.

00:08:03.840 --> 00:08:06.980
I know. Once the show's over,

00:08:07.750 --> 00:08:13.280
I want to give the song you gave to me, back to you, full of love.

00:08:14.080 --> 00:08:16.960
W-With love?

00:08:16.960 --> 00:08:18.630
Look forward to it.

00:08:19.970 --> 00:08:21.060
I-I will.

00:08:23.060 --> 00:08:27.700
We plan to hold a public viewing at our subsidiary cinema complex.

00:08:27.700 --> 00:08:31.300
Every audience member will feel the presence of the space.

00:08:28.610 --> 00:08:32.250
Are you sure you don't need to talk to him before the day of the event?

00:08:31.300 --> 00:08:34.500
Aside from events, we deal in various devices.

00:08:34.020 --> 00:08:35.780
He's an adult now.

00:08:34.500 --> 00:08:37.320
Currently, we are making progress in apps and e-books.

00:08:37.320 --> 00:08:41.250
He knows he's the face of this event.

00:08:42.240 --> 00:08:44.440
There's no need for me to see him now.

00:09:02.610 --> 00:09:04.210
<i>Mister Ittoki.</i>

00:09:04.210 --> 00:09:04.920
<i>Yes?</i>

00:09:04.920 --> 00:09:08.170
<i>Work good and hard.</i>

00:09:08.170 --> 00:09:09.560
<i>O-Okay.</i>

00:09:44.750 --> 00:09:47.320
The show is tomorrow.

00:09:47.810 --> 00:09:48.850
Yeah.

00:09:48.850 --> 00:09:53.350
By the way, your variety show the other day was funny.

00:09:53.350 --> 00:09:55.490
What? You saw that?

00:09:55.490 --> 00:09:58.920
Do you really have no intention of becoming an idol?

00:09:58.920 --> 00:10:00.790
N-Not at all.

00:10:05.040 --> 00:10:08.770
Ren, why did you become an idol?

00:10:11.700 --> 00:10:14.470
My brother told me to do it.

00:10:14.470 --> 00:10:18.470
What?! You became an idol at your family's recommendation?

00:10:20.420 --> 00:10:22.850
It doesn't matter how you start...

00:10:23.560 --> 00:10:25.270
As long as you're serious about it now.

00:10:37.590 --> 00:10:39.110
Haruka!

00:10:40.420 --> 00:10:41.710
Oh, good.

00:10:41.710 --> 00:10:42.920
Tomo.

00:10:42.920 --> 00:10:45.500
I was worried you might have gotten lost.

00:10:47.520 --> 00:10:49.500
Anyway, this is amazing.

00:10:50.040 --> 00:10:52.980
It's the Boys Collection, but it's mostly girls.

00:10:53.910 --> 00:10:56.480
Now that you mention it, that <i>is</i> strange.

00:10:56.480 --> 00:10:59.510
They're probably all here to see the rising hotties.

00:11:00.760 --> 00:11:05.510
Jinguji Ren is the center of attention even among them.

00:11:05.510 --> 00:11:09.350
It took him no time at all to get all these fans since he debuted.

00:11:09.350 --> 00:11:11.090
Maybe it's his talent.

00:11:11.090 --> 00:11:13.320
He works hard too.

00:11:13.320 --> 00:11:13.960
What?

00:11:14.300 --> 00:11:16.060
Cecil.

00:11:16.060 --> 00:11:17.370
Cecil?

00:11:17.370 --> 00:11:21.740
This is the guy the president scouted for the Master Course?

00:11:21.740 --> 00:11:25.000
Tomo, it's your first time meeting Cecil, right?

00:11:22.550 --> 00:11:25.000
Look, isn't he super hot?

00:11:25.000 --> 00:11:27.500
Let me introduce you. Um...

00:11:25.000 --> 00:11:27.500
You're right. He must be a model.

00:11:27.500 --> 00:11:29.030
Maybe.

00:11:27.500 --> 00:11:30.870
Shibuya Tomochika, Haruka's former roommate.

00:11:30.870 --> 00:11:31.870
What?

00:11:31.870 --> 00:11:35.970
Uh, did I tell you about her?

00:11:35.970 --> 00:11:39.190
No. I simply know everything about you, Haruka.

00:11:39.190 --> 00:11:39.910
What?

00:11:40.340 --> 00:11:45.610
I see. Ringo told me a ridiculous kid had come, but...

00:11:46.870 --> 00:11:49.190
Cecil, I heard you're in the Master Course,

00:11:49.190 --> 00:11:50.890
even though you're not interested in becoming an idol!

00:11:51.460 --> 00:11:54.900
I'll never forgive you if you do anything weird to Haruka.

00:11:56.580 --> 00:11:59.190
"Jinguji Ren?" What is this?

00:11:59.190 --> 00:12:02.990
I gave those songs to everyone.

00:12:02.990 --> 00:12:05.480
I'm not done with yours yet, Cecil.

00:12:06.120 --> 00:12:08.940
It's all right. Don't worry about it.

00:12:08.940 --> 00:12:10.640
I'll wait.

00:12:10.640 --> 00:12:12.840
I'll be fine as long as I have these songs.

00:12:14.150 --> 00:12:15.300
That's enough for six people!

00:12:17.120 --> 00:12:19.730
JBC!

00:12:19.730 --> 00:12:22.240
It's starting now!

00:12:22.240 --> 00:12:23.550
What a good view.

00:12:25.590 --> 00:12:26.550
It's packed.

00:12:27.090 --> 00:12:30.230
Mister Ren's popularity is especially impressive.

00:12:30.230 --> 00:12:32.300
It's all according to plan.

00:12:32.300 --> 00:12:33.430
Look at that.

00:12:33.430 --> 00:12:36.440
Isn't that the president of the Jinguji Conglomerate?

00:12:36.440 --> 00:12:37.150
What?

00:12:37.150 --> 00:12:39.920
The chief executive of this show...

00:12:39.920 --> 00:12:41.670
Jinguji's older brother.

00:12:41.670 --> 00:12:43.680
What? His older brother?

00:13:17.580 --> 00:13:19.210
Jinguji.

00:13:19.210 --> 00:13:21.820
He looks so cool.

00:13:40.960 --> 00:13:42.940
Huh? What?

00:13:42.940 --> 00:13:43.710
Did the power go out?

00:13:45.590 --> 00:13:47.680
What? The ceiling and everything?

00:13:48.130 --> 00:13:50.910
Yes, even the house lights.

00:13:50.910 --> 00:13:52.040
What about our backups?

00:13:52.040 --> 00:13:54.040
Um, give me a minute.

00:13:54.040 --> 00:13:55.410
What are you doing? Hurry up.

00:13:55.410 --> 00:13:57.120
People are going to panic.

00:13:57.120 --> 00:13:58.560
Make an announcement immediately.

00:13:58.560 --> 00:14:01.840
We can't. The sound isn't working, either.

00:14:01.840 --> 00:14:03.650
If we had another PA system...

00:14:05.160 --> 00:14:07.010
We'll use the hall's operator room.

00:14:07.010 --> 00:14:08.150
What?

00:14:08.150 --> 00:14:09.770
What's happening?

00:14:09.770 --> 00:14:11.470
Oh, come on!

00:14:11.470 --> 00:14:13.590
I'm scared!

00:14:13.590 --> 00:14:15.550
What's going to happen now?

00:14:15.550 --> 00:14:16.920
<i>This isn't good.</i>

00:14:17.370 --> 00:14:20.020
<i>At this rate, the show will be ruined.</i>

00:14:20.800 --> 00:14:22.520
<i>And the audience...</i>

00:14:24.680 --> 00:14:29.150
<i>I like your music, Jinguji.</i>

00:14:29.750 --> 00:14:33.850
<i>When I listen to your music, my heart heats up.</i>

00:14:34.420 --> 00:14:36.390
<i>My heart lights up.</i>

00:14:46.200 --> 00:14:48.110
Listen up, ladies!

00:14:49.680 --> 00:14:51.110
It's all right!

00:14:53.890 --> 00:14:59.150
Don't you think there are feelings that are conveyed better in the dark?

00:14:59.620 --> 00:15:05.750
I feel like we can almost hear the sound of each other's breath and hearts.

00:15:06.130 --> 00:15:07.840
What is he doing?

00:15:08.550 --> 00:15:10.720
Listen, My Lady.

00:15:11.230 --> 00:15:13.990
With my song, I want to...

00:15:15.430 --> 00:15:17.020
Light up your hearts.

00:15:19.640 --> 00:15:21.670
What? A song?

00:15:23.600 --> 00:15:27.700
Cecil, give me Jinguji's disc of songs.

00:15:27.700 --> 00:15:30.070
What? Let's see...

00:15:30.520 --> 00:15:31.430
Is this it?

00:15:31.430 --> 00:15:32.820
Yes, thank you.

00:15:32.820 --> 00:15:34.490
Is my voice reaching you?

00:15:34.490 --> 00:15:36.120
Yes!

00:15:36.120 --> 00:15:36.850
Haruka.

00:15:36.850 --> 00:15:38.470
Can you hear me on the second floor?

00:15:37.260 --> 00:15:41.790
Yes, yes. Everything's fine over here.

00:15:42.620 --> 00:15:45.220
Miss, please return to your seat.

00:15:45.220 --> 00:15:46.980
I'm in a hurry.

00:15:46.980 --> 00:15:49.230
Only authorized personnel are allowed through here.

00:15:49.230 --> 00:15:49.830
What's going on?

00:15:51.450 --> 00:15:53.270
Jinguji's brother!

00:15:53.700 --> 00:15:57.510
I need you to put this on immediately.

00:16:00.930 --> 00:16:01.600
Who are you?

00:16:01.600 --> 00:16:04.480
I'm a composer for ST☆RISH!

00:16:05.460 --> 00:16:08.440
For ST☆RISH? You?

00:16:09.510 --> 00:16:10.910
Give me that.

00:16:10.910 --> 00:16:11.190
What?

00:16:11.620 --> 00:16:13.320
Quickly. I'll go.

00:16:20.360 --> 00:16:21.370
<i>Ren...</i>

00:16:23.040 --> 00:16:24.600
<i>Just wait, Ren.</i>

00:17:09.090 --> 00:17:10.640
Please hurry.

00:17:33.880 --> 00:17:35.550
<i>Is that you, Little Lamb?</i>

00:17:37.820 --> 00:17:40.000
<i>Okay, my honey.</i>

00:17:40.000 --> 00:17:41.220
<i>That's a good girl.</i>

00:18:30.110 --> 00:18:32.590
<i>Wh-What is this?</i>

00:18:33.540 --> 00:18:34.830
<i>Amazing...</i>

00:19:00.580 --> 00:19:02.010
Jinguji!

00:19:03.910 --> 00:19:09.390
My Lady, I'm sorry for suddenly singing that song today.

00:19:09.390 --> 00:19:12.360
I promised I would only sing it for you.

00:19:12.360 --> 00:19:15.430
Don't worry about it.

00:19:15.430 --> 00:19:20.200
Everyone looked so excited and happy.

00:19:20.790 --> 00:19:24.110
I was so glad when I saw that.

00:19:24.110 --> 00:19:25.440
Lady...

00:19:25.440 --> 00:19:29.570
Jinguji, your voice was so passionate and wonderful.

00:19:33.540 --> 00:19:36.680
Does that mean you felt my love?

00:19:37.560 --> 00:19:39.050
Um, I...

00:19:39.640 --> 00:19:44.550
You're such a bad girl for making me so crazy for you.

00:19:47.260 --> 00:19:48.870
Jinguji...

00:19:57.790 --> 00:19:58.850
It's all right.

00:19:59.350 --> 00:20:02.110
I need you...

00:20:02.530 --> 00:20:06.760
So I'll wait until you become an adult.

00:20:09.720 --> 00:20:12.110
Mister Seiichiro, how could you be so reckless?

00:20:12.110 --> 00:20:14.080
It's no big deal.

00:20:15.870 --> 00:20:18.440
S-Sorry for bothering you.

00:20:22.900 --> 00:20:25.100
Your quick wit saved the show.

00:20:25.100 --> 00:20:28.100
I didn't expect you to sing then.

00:20:29.310 --> 00:20:30.930
I should be thanking you.

00:20:30.930 --> 00:20:35.140
You hurt yourself trying to play my song.

00:20:36.130 --> 00:20:38.570
Not bad for a chief executive.

00:20:38.570 --> 00:20:42.510
You idiot! I didn't do it because I'm the chief executive.

00:20:42.510 --> 00:20:43.720
I did it for you.

00:20:44.480 --> 00:20:45.610
For me?

00:20:46.850 --> 00:20:48.680
Do you still bear a grudge against me?

00:20:49.680 --> 00:20:53.360
For forcing you to attend Saotome Academy.

00:20:54.680 --> 00:20:56.160
No.

00:20:57.500 --> 00:21:01.880
It wasn't our father or mother who supported me then.

00:21:03.040 --> 00:21:04.350
It was your songs.

00:21:06.020 --> 00:21:09.280
You have a special power that draws people to you.

00:21:09.280 --> 00:21:12.500
I know. That's why you made me your poster boy.

00:21:12.500 --> 00:21:13.210
No.

00:21:15.110 --> 00:21:18.450
You were particularly rebellious back then.

00:21:18.450 --> 00:21:20.710
I couldn't think of any other way to tell you.

00:21:23.550 --> 00:21:26.790
But it seems I wasn't wrong.

00:21:27.800 --> 00:21:30.140
Mister Seiichiro, the time...

00:21:30.880 --> 00:21:34.850
I've always loved your songs.

00:21:38.140 --> 00:21:41.230
Do your best, Jinguji Ren.

00:21:41.550 --> 00:21:42.470
See you later.

00:21:54.960 --> 00:21:57.080
<i>It seems I wasn't wrong.</i>

00:21:57.810 --> 00:22:01.170
<i>You were particularly rebellious back then.</i>

00:22:01.170 --> 00:22:03.600
<i>I couldn't think of any other way to tell you.</i>

00:22:04.290 --> 00:22:08.190
Did you say that to make me enter the music industry?

00:22:09.430 --> 00:22:11.540
<i>I didn't do it because I'm the chief executive.</i>

00:22:11.540 --> 00:22:13.030
<i>I did it for you.</i>

00:22:14.030 --> 00:22:17.770
<i>I've always loved your songs.</i>

00:22:21.650 --> 00:22:24.300
Are you saying you've always been watching me?

00:22:27.920 --> 00:22:29.510
You sure are something.
